  "prompt": "For each quarter of 2025, how many of the users who signed up in it reached each step of the signup funnel: signed up, activated, paid? A user counts as activated with a first_campaign_sent event, and as paid with at least one payment, refunded or not; a user counts at a step only when the user also reached the step before, at any time. signup_ts is a UTC instant, read in UTC. Return four columns, in this order: signup_quarter (the first day of the quarter, in UTC), signed_up, activated and paid, each a number of users. Return one row for each quarter. Any row order is fine.",
